# Nova Freight V1 production freeze

AMICOR NOVA FREIGHT V1 SOFTWARE BUILD FROZEN after Phase 7 (2026-09-09).

Do not change Nova Freight V1 unless the user explicitly requests a verified production bug, security issue, legal/compliance requirement, or launch-critical business fix.

See `docs/AMICOR_NOVA_FREIGHT_V1_PRODUCTION_FREEZE.md`.

## Protected

- Freight shipment, offer, lifecycle, proof, quote, invoice, Stripe TEST charge, payout, settlement, remittance
- `/nova/freight*` UI and `/api/nova/freight*` APIs
- `nova_freight_*` tables and Phase 1–7 tests

## Still prohibited

- Stripe LIVE / real customer charges
- Real carrier payouts or Stripe Connect live transfers
- Tax / 1099, payout batching, analytics dashboards, marketplace/ELD integrations
- Changes to frozen Delivery, Driver 001, or Health billing/lifecycle
